    '## Offline conditional live remainder','',
    'The [offline calculator](data/baselines/calculator.py) keeps all counted A/B/other candidate votes fixed. It forecasts only a supplied remaining all-contest pool, its pair participation and A pair share, plus an explicit named-other allocation. FINAL pair denominator is countedA+B+remainingpair; FINAL all-candidate denominator is allcounted+allremaining. With counted net`L`, remaining pair pool`U`and final pair total`T_final`, tie requires`(U−L)/(2U)`; pair A+1requires`(U+.01*T_final−L)/(2U)`. Selected-pool requirements hold other remaining-pool assumptions fixed. The full-field check separately requires A to exceed B **and every named other candidate**.','',
